| 4 | Stored XSS via innerHTML | sandbox-royal.securegateway.com | Medium | BLOCKED by WAF |
| 5 | CSRF + CAPTCHA Bypass | sandbox-royal.securegateway.com | Info | Confirmed |
| 6 | 7 AJAX Endpoints | sandbox-royal.securegateway.com | Info | Confirmed |
| 7 | Outdated Libraries | sandbox-royal.securegateway.com | Info | Confirmed |

**Honest Assessment**: None of these findings are bounty-worthy as standalone findings. The program requires "full hack" (edit index page or download database). The most promising lead is the complaint stored XSS chain (ALSCO-04), but the WAF blocks all exploit attempts. We need a clean residential IP to continue testing.

**What would make this bounty-worthy**:
1. WAF bypass for G.S.941100 (angle brackets blocked)
2. File upload path discovery (upload → RCE)
3. Phone verification bypass (auth → admin panel)

